# Bug hunt H-06: Generate mesh on a CHT tutorial (flat 0.orig) gives every region its fields, as the tutorial's Allrun.pre
# does: 0.orig to 0, split, fluid fields out of the solids, changeDictionary per region. Real OpenFOAM.
open $SB/ws/multiRegionHeater
click nav:mesh
wait-until page Mesh
click mesh-gen
wait-until job running timeout 20
wait-until job finished timeout 300
assert file 0/heater/T
assert file 0/bottomWater/U
assert not file 0/heater/U
assert not log log.changeDictionary does not exist
click nav:boundaries
wait-until page Boundary
assert not text No field files were found
